zh:
例：$A=\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\2&4&6\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}$。行变换：
$$\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\2&4&6\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow{r_2-2r_1}\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\0&0&0\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow{r_3-r_1}\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\0&0&0\\0&-1&-2\end{pmatrix},$$
交换第 $2,3$ 行得行阶梯形，非零行有 $2$ 行，故 $r(A)=2$。也可直接看出第 $2$ 行是第 $1$ 行的 $2$ 倍，而第 $1,3$ 行不成比例，故行秩为 $2$。取 $b=(3,6,2)^{\mathrm T}$，有 $A(1,1,0)^{\mathrm T}=b$，且 $r(A\mid b)=2=r(A)$，方程组有解；取 $b=(0,1,0)^{\mathrm T}$，$A$ 的列空间由 $(1,2,1)^{\mathrm T}$ 与 $(3,6,1)^{\mathrm T}$ 张成，其中每个向量 $(x,y,z)^{\mathrm T}$ 都满足 $y=2x$，而 $b$ 不满足，故 $b\notin\operatorname{col}(A)$，即 $r(A\mid b)=3\ne2$，方程组无解。

en:
Example: $A=\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\2&4&6\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}$. Row reduction gives
$$\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\2&4&6\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow{r_2-2r_1}\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\0&0&0\\1&1&1\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow{r_3-r_1}\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\0&0&0\\0&-1&-2\end{pmatrix},$$
and after swapping rows $2,3$ we have a row echelon form with two nonzero rows, so $r(A)=2$. Alternatively, row $2$ is twice row $1$, while rows $1$ and $3$ are not proportional, so the row rank is $2$. For $b=(3,6,2)^{\mathrm T}$, $A(1,1,0)^{\mathrm T}=b$ and $r(A\mid b)=2=r(A)$, so the system is consistent. For $b=(0,1,0)^{\mathrm T}$, the column space of $A$ is spanned by $(1,2,1)^{\mathrm T}$ and $(3,6,1)^{\mathrm T}$, and every vector $(x,y,z)^{\mathrm T}$ in it satisfies $y=2x$; $b$ does not, so $b\notin\operatorname{col}(A)$, that is, $r(A\mid b)=3\ne2$, and the system is inconsistent.
